    "body": "\n> @copilot\r\n> - name: Trust brew taps\r\n>   run: brew trust aws/tap azure/bicep\r...\n\nImplemented in commit `db2fbbb`.\n\nI restored tap trust handling with compatibility guards in both macOS jobs:\n- checks whether `brew trust` exists (`brew commands | grep -qx trust`)\n- trusts `aws/tap` and `azure/bicep` separately\n- keeps trust failures non-fatal so unsupported/temporary trust issues won’t fail the workflow.",
